---
title: "MemberWithTeams Composition (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_member: receive Member
    q_load_member --> q_load_teams: load member data
    q_load_teams --> q_iter_relations: query MemberTeamRelation by member_id
    q_iter_relations --> q_resolve_team: relation found
    q_iter_relations --> q_load_metadata: no more relations
    q_resolve_team --> q_add_team: resolve Team by team_id
    q_add_team --> q_iter_relations: append to teams array
    q_load_metadata --> q_load_avatar: raw_user_meta_data = auth metadata
    q_load_avatar --> q_check_avatar: fetch avatar_url
    q_check_avatar --> q_set_avatar: avatar_url != null
    q_check_avatar --> q_null_avatar: avatar_url = null
    q_set_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = string
    q_null_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = null
    q_final --> [*]: return MemberWithTeams

    note right of q_iter_relations
        INV-001: teams array contains all teams member belongs to
        INV-002: raw_user_meta_data preserves all auth provider metadata
        INV-003: MemberWithTeams includes all Member fields
    end note
